Z||000000||GT Bastard||02-23-2000||05:31 PM||||I finally broke down and ordered the Fiero video for 30 stinkin' bucks at the Fiero Store.  I think it was wayyy overpriced, but I love it!  The segment where they compare the supercharged MR2 to the Fiero is baddass.  They show them doin' 0-60's and racing around a nice track.  They used an '88 Formula 5-sp against the MR2. The Fiero was a tiny bit slower, but they still chose the Fiero over the MR2.  They make the '84 WS6 Fiero look like a lot of fun to drive too.  They even seemed to favor the '84 w/WS6 package over the 85-87 GT.  Crazy.....  check it out guys...||||reg||4
