Z||000006||ChadMan||02-23-2000||09:19 PM||||I bought that video too, Bastard.  Isn't it great?  I love the 88 intro where they've got red and yellow GT's and Formulas racing around at Mid-Ohio - plus you get actual video proof that at least one yellow GT was built with power steering.<P>But I think it's BS when they spin the 86 GT in the lane-change test and claim it's due to lift-throttle oversteer.  If you watch closely, you can see the nose dive - it's pretty clear that their test driver just came in too hot, braked hard while turning and spun the car.  Driver error!<P>Now don't all you guys want to rush out and buy this video???||||reg||1
